<div class="container clearfix what_we_believe_section">
  <div class="row mobile-padding-15" id="home-about">
    <div class="col-sm-4 col-12">
      <h1 class="home-text">
        Creating <br>
Landmarks <br>
<span> since 1971 </span>      </h1>
      <div id="home-about-sub-text" class="padding-top-20 padding-bottom-50">
        <p>A legacy brand, Goyal &amp; Co. has been one of the top builders in Ahmedabad since 1971. As property developers, we believe that we are not in the business of just making spaces but of creating landmarks that redefine living and workspaces. The testament of our expertise and evolution are the 250+ projects developed in the last five decades.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="aboutUsLink">
        <a class="hover-btn-effect" href="https://goyalco.com/goyal-co/"> About Us → </a>
